msgctxt "DefaultTalk:591340:0:20"
msgid "Well, if it isn't <if ($gn52 > 0)><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>, slayer of  “Great” King Moggle Mog XII─may he... \\<cough> Ahem."
msgstr "Ну и ну, <if ($gn52 > 0)><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>, победитель «великого» короля Могла Мога XII... Царствие ему... кхм. Так вот."

#. ja: 双蛇党の一員として、またグリダニアの民として、<br>一言お礼をさせてほしい。<br>……ありがとう、<if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 < 127)>君は双蛇党の誇りだ。<else>君の力を借りられてよかった。</if><else>君の力を借りられてよかった。</if>
#. de: Als Mitglied der Bruderschaft und Bewohner Gridanias möchte ich dir ganz herzlich danken. <if ($gn52 > 0)>Es ist gut, dich an unserer Seite zu wissen<else><if ($gn53 > 0)>Ich bin stolz, in derselben Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft zu dienen wie du<else>Es ist gut, dich an unserer Seite zu wissen</if></if>.
#. fr: Je vous remercie au nom de notre nation pour vos efforts héroïques. <if ($gn52 > 0)>Gridania a une dette envers vous.<else><if ($gn53 > 0)>Vous êtes un modèle pour les autres soldats de l'ordre.<else>Gridania a une dette envers vous.</if></if>
#. column 20: Well, if it isn't <if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>, slayer of  “Great” King Moggle Mog XII─may he... \<cough> Ahem.
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)>Gridania is indebted to you for your aid.<else><if ($gn53 > 0)>You are a model to your fellow Serpents.<else>Gridania is indebted to you for you… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)>You are a model to your fellow Serpents.<else>Gridania is indebted to you for your aid.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:591340:0:21"
msgid "On behalf of our entire nation, I thank you for your heroic efforts. <if ($gn52 > 0)>Gridania is indebted to you for your aid.<else><if ($gn53 > 0)>You are a model to your fellow Serpents.<else>Gridania is indebted to you for your aid.</if></if>"
msgstr "От лица всего нашего народа благодарю тебя за подвиги. <if ($gn52 > 0)>Гридания у тебя в долгу.<else><if ($gn53 > 0)>Ты служишь примером для своих соратников по Ордену Змеи.<else>Гридания у тебя в долгу.</if></if>"

#. ja: おかげさまで、シルフ領の問題も一段落だ。<br>黒衣森が、またひとつ穏やかさを取り戻したというわけさ。
#. de: Dank dir ist das Sylphen-Problem fürs erste aus der Welt geschafft und im Wald der Einkehr bestimmt endlich wieder ein etwas friedlicherer Grundton den Tag.
#. fr: Nous avons souvent recours à la force pour régler nos problèmes avec les tribus barbares, mais ce n'est jamais de bon cœur. Vos exploits au Refuge ont prouvé que la paix n'est pas un rêve impossible.
#. column 21: For returning a measure of quietude to the Twelveswood, the elementals surely smile upon us. You have my thanks, <if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>.
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:591341:0:20"
msgid "Oft have we resorted to force to resolve our disputes with the beastmen, but not without heavy hearts. Voyce's exploits in Little Solace─in which you played an ample role, or so I hear─are welcome proof that peace is yet within our reach."
msgstr "Благодаря тебе с сильфийской угрозой пока покончено, и лес снова стал чуточку спокойнее."

#. ja: 恩に着るよ、<if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 < 127)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if>。<br>対蛮族に割く兵力を減らせることは、<br>我々にとって大きな成果だからね。
#. de: Wir sind dir zutiefst für deine Hilfe verbunden, <if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if> <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>! Je weniger Truppen wir im Kampf gegen Wilde Stämme einsetzen müssen, desto besser.
#. fr: Une partie de nos soldats pourra être redéployée ailleurs. Gridania vous doit beaucoup, <if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 < 127)><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if>.
