msgctxt "DefaultTalk:591346:0:20"
msgid "<if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>! I have heard word of your victory over that calamitous sea snake!"
msgstr "<if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>! До меня дошли вести о твоей победе над морским чудовищем!"

#. ja: キミが協力してくれなきゃ、リムサ・ロミンサは……<br>ううん、ラノシア全域がどうなっていたことか。<br><if ($gn52 > 0)><if ($gn52 < 127)>君は黒渦団の誇りだね<else>恩に着るよ</if><else>恩に着るよ</if>、ありがとう！
#. de: Ohne dich wäre Limsa Lominsa vermutlich vom Antlitz dieser Welt gespült worden ... Ja, ganz La Noscea wäre vielleicht dem Untergang geweiht gewesen. <if ($gn52 > 0)>Der Mahlstrom kann stolz auf dich sein<else><if ($gn53 > 0)>Wir schulden dir unendlich viel<else>Wir schulden dir unendlich viel</if></if>!
#. fr: 0
#. column 20: <if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>! I have heard word of your victory over that calamitous sea snake!
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)>You are the pride of the Maelstrom<else><if ($gn53 > 0)>You are a true hero<else>You are a true hero</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
